WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:02.610
Wow!

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.780
These are amazing! Your dad really is great, Erika!

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:08.360
Huh?

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.320
I'm glad you like them, Tsubomi!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.450
Hey, don't just photograph us out of the blue like that!

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.880
Your father really is a superb 
photographer though, isn't he?

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.140
That's not the point...

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.000
This is a really sweet photograph.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:25.670
It's a photo of a family I owe an awful lot to.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.710
Brings back some old memories...

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.170
Erika...

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:32.530
May I see your family photos too?

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.840
I know they're going to be really amazing!

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.810
We don't have any!

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:41.600
Dad takes all our photos, so he's not in any of them.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.050
Right, Dad?

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.440
I never noticed, but you're right!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:50.500
Is this to be my fate as a photographer?! {I kind of want to use 'burden' for 'fate'. But lit: 宿命 【しゅくめい】 (n) fate; destiny; predestination}

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:51.360
Dad?

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.940
All right! We're going on a family vacation!

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:56.160
Would you like to come along 
as our photographer, Tsubomi?

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.990
I'd love to! Leave it to me!

00:00:58.990 --> 00:00:59.010
{OP}

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.200
HeartCatch

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.660
Precure!

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.250
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.210
Now, all together

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.720
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.680
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:20.770 --> 00:01:23.300
Within each of our chests,

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.970
they begin to sprout

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:27.640
The seeds of the heart

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:28.940
are growing

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.570
bit by bit

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:32.240
Red,

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:32.860
white

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:34.150
and yellow

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.900
It's because these blooming buds are

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.320
all varied colors

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.780
that they

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:42.000
shine so brightly!

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:47.330
That smile that you've nurtured

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:49.830
with such care

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.550
will never wither

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:56.090
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:58.970
Now, all together

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:01.470
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.140
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:09.060
They're always right by our sides

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:09.850
So together

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:13.730
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:16.650
bloom even more!

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.150
HeartCatch

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.650
Precure!

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:29.430
We're off to visit a family I know who helped me out when I was younger.

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:32.420
Their daughter's about to get married, apparently.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.710
Ohhh!

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.860
Hey, Tsubomi?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:40.550
Tsubomi, you don't have to take pictures until we get there, you know?{Moving down to not block the display.}

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.010
No! I am a photographer!

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.560
I'll be on the lookout no matter when or where I may be!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.370
Good afternoon!

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.100
Wait, what?

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.940
I guess Tadashi and Aki must be out in the fields.{lit: TADASHI-SAN-TACHI}

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.550
We've made a new friend!

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:00.660
His name's Maru!

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.780
We're just gonna go look over here for a sec, okay?!

00:03:04.220 --> 00:03:06.040
Jeez, don't just show yourselves like that!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:07.450
Come on, Dad!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.340
Just listen to me!

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:12.500
We've talked about this several times before!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.960
I'll be fine on my own. I like tending the fields.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:17.790
Dad!

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:23.930
It's Tadashi!

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.650
Oh, Ryuunosuke!

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.020
Sorry we weren't around to greet you. {in -> around}

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:34.440
It's quite all right. We're intruding at a busy time for you, after all.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.290
So you're getting married this month, Aki?

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:38.460
I am, yes.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.030
Well, welcome to you all!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.360
I'm glad you could all make it.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.910
So what're you growing in the fields?!

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:47.950
Potatoes at this time of year.

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.790
Oh, I can't wait to try them!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.870
Glad to see you're enthusiastic, Erika.

00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:56.000
Well then, why don't you two go get 
changed and come help me in the field? {lot -> all. BRITISH}

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.050
Okaaaaay!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:05.600
A Wedding in Tears<i>!</i>

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:05.600
A Wedding in Tears<i>!</i>

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.720
All right then! I'm gonna get some big ones!

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:15.150
What's with these things? They won't budge at all!

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:16.900
You have to do this...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.390
Oh, I see.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.090
Now try pulling them.

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:23.990
Okay!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.270
Hey, I did it! Look at these, Tsubomi!

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.540
Nice job!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.720
Oh, this is a good chance for a photo! {lit. engrish "shutter chance". I hate you, Japan.}

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:33.660
Yay!

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.330
Here, try one of these.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.300
Take a look at this!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:40.630
What?

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.610
A tomato's most delicious

00:04:42.610 --> 00:04:46.300
when these white lines have spread out, and you can just see the insides through them. {Removed the apostrophe in 'its' - it's = it is.}

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.160
Here, try it.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:52.150
Ugh! I don't like tomatoes. They're too sour...

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.310
You'll like it, really! Just take a bite out of it!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.260
Huh... It really is nice.

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:04.530
It's not sour at all!

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.250
Tsubomi, this is really, really good!

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.910
Oh, that's another good chance for a photo! {MATAMATA SHUTTER CHANCE DESU}

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.290
They really are tasty, and sweet too.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.830
Hey, mister... {I can't do mouthfullese D:}

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.250
Seconds please!

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:23.050
You really do raise your tomatoes with a lot of love, don't you?

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:26.040
You seem to know a lot about them, don'tcha?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.570
Yup! I love flowers, so I grow a lot of them myself.

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:30.720
Well, that's good!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:36.440
Any plant or vegetable can be considered beautiful if you treat them with love and affection.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.400
What's the matter?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.830
Oh, it's a frog!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.140
Get it away, Tsubomi! Get it away from me!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.630
What's the problem? It's so cute.

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.790
Oh, this is a good chance for a photo!

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.860
Cat's paws! Meoooow!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.190
Give it to me for a second. {Changed it from 'give it here a second so it's a little less Britishy.}

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:25.280
Just make a cat's paw with your left hand.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.400
It's a simple trick when cooking.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:36.870
Let's dig in! {tuck in -> eat}

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.220
It's delicious!

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.840
Whoa! It's really delicious!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.580
It really is.

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.330
Vegetables really do taste better when they're fresh.

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:50.270
Yeah. I'm really glad we came!

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.550
I want to stay here forever!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.100
It really is nice to have so many people around! {He says 'it's nice because it's bustling' but I think that's kind of redundant in English when you've already specified you have a shit-ton of people there.}

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:01.560
Oh, Aki. How're preparations for your wedding going?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:05.270
Oh, right. All that's left to do is close on our new house. {finalize -> close - that's the American wording.}

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:11.150
I see.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:15.530
So once you get married, Tadashi will be living here on his own, huh?

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.870
I imagine it'll be quite lonely for you.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:21.210
Not at all, not at all! I'll finally be able to relax a little.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.290
Well then, I guess if Erika stayed, she'd just be a nuisance.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.940
It's amazing how much noise one girl can make.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.210
That's not fair, Momo!

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.080
I'm totally stuffed and lovin' it... {♪Bada ba ba ba~♪ XD "and lovin' it" should cover the missing 幸せ at the end of this line n.n}

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.120
I also ate way too much.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.820
What're those? The photos from today?

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:42.600
Yup!

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:45.360
You just printed them?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:48.070
Yeah. Everyone's really enjoying themselves.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.240
Mind if I take a look?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.330
Of course! {From 'Sure, you're more than welcome!' - please add 'tzuria' to editor credits for this episode :3}

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.450
Thank you.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:01.620
This is...

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.340
Oh, that's the best photo I took today.

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:10.460
When he was talking about tomatoes, he seemed so happy that I just pressed the shutter without thinking.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:14.010
Yeah, that tomato was delicious...

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.230
Your father really does love 
tending to his crops, doesn't he?

00:08:22.380 --> 00:08:25.730
But if I get married...

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.540
Dad will be left all on his own.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:33.520
I can't...

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.940
I can't be his wife if it means abandoning Dad...

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.610
Aki...

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.460
Non, non, non!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:56.140
Is there nowhere that would 
better complement my beauty?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:01.500
"This place is dull, so we should go
 somewhere with a bit of nature," is it?{Querying their dialogue, so question mark outside quotes o k????} {NO FUCK YOU. Added a tiny bit of text so you cannot have your questionmark outside your quotes. NON NON NON.}

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.560
I suppose you're right...

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.370
All right then! Allons-y!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:15.650
It's nice to take a morning stroll every now and then, huh?

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:20.660
Tsubomi, Maru says he's worried about Aki.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.700
Huh?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.840
Wait, you can speak dog?!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.830
We've become good friends already!

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:28.680
I'd love to be able to help her, but...

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:30.200
Tsubomi...

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.080
Why won't you just listen to me?!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:32.460
Huh?

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.300
Please, just give up farming and come live in the city with us!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.390
Aki?

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.990
I've been a farmer my whole life.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.300
I can't just give it up that easily.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:45.160
You know that as well as anyone, Aki.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:50.230
If you're going to stay here, 
Dad, then I can't get married!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.860
Why're you saying such stupid things? {Line disappears a bit fast, can we extend this slightly?}

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.630
I'll keep on farming this land even after you've left. {once -> when}

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:00.200
These fields are precious to me.

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:03.290
Fine then!

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.250
What should we do, Tsubomi?!

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.080
Why are you asking me?!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.240
Oh! Dad! Let's ask him for advice!

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.960
Sounds good to meeee...

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:30.900
And that's what happened.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.610
It seems Aki's been constantly worrying about him.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.560
Aki's such a kind girl, after all...

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.030
Dad, can't you sort this out?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.070
Please help her!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.530
All right then! Leave it to me!

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:46.950
Good luck, Dad!

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:51.280
Aki, getting married is supposed 
to be the happiest day of your life.{Just says 'a very happy occasion' but let's apply some ~western cliche~ to it.}

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:54.800
Tadashi sounded ecstatic when
 he told me about it on the phone.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:58.820
Ever since you were young, you've always been the most important thing to him...

00:10:58.820 --> 00:10:59.730
That's not...

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.470
That's not true anymore.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:08.180
Those fields have become more
 important to my father than I am!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.390
A-Aki?!

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:15.650
Dad, you idiot! All you've done is make Aki storm off...

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.280
What do we do now?

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:25.370
Dad's so fixated on his photos that he never bothers to understand how people might be feeling.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:29.720
Your dad's a man with a lot of love in his heart,

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:32.830
for both people and photos. He's been that way ever since we first met.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.340
Okay, let's take a quick break. We can't shoot if the model's crying.

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.010
Um...

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:43.210
If you don't mind, would you take a look at these photos of mine?

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:45.590
These are...

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:46.480
Look.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:48.560
They all seem really happy, don't they? 

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.170
So please, try to cheer up.

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.520
Because I'm sure if I can capture your smile, then, well...

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.540
it'll be even more beautiful than any of those.

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:04.240
Well, you're obviously prettier than a horse...{DAT TSUBOMI}

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:08.540
Your dad tried his hardest to cheer me up.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:12.920
Erika, it isn't just that he loves photography.

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:18.380
It's that he loves the people and 
objects he captures within his photos.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:22.220
Dad's photos always manage to make me feel warm inside.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:25.970
I'm sure if you just let him deal with Aki, he'll sort it all out.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.560
It'd be nice if he did, but...

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:30.210
Hey, Erika!

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.020
Dad?

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:33.910
What're you doing?

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.820
Can you call Aki over for me?

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.700
I want to take a family photo of them.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.650
That's not going to help...

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.530
The emotions captured by a photograph will never truly fade away.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:48.530
That's how I know that Tadashi still cares for Aki just as much as he did back then.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.190
That's what I want her to see.

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:52.210
Dad!

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.160
Erika, let's go find her!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:54.970
Right!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.150
Where are we, might I ask?

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:02.970
The air here is far too fresh. I feel nauseous.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:04.510
Huh?

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.760
Hey, you over there!

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:09.430
You should respond when I talk to you.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.140
And yet you don't, even though I grace you with my voice?!

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.290
What the heck's with you?!

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.860
Wait, it's a scarecrow.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:21.070
Excuse me! Could you not walk through the fields, please?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:21.980
Huh?

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:23.360
That girl...

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:30.240
The Flower of her Heart is wilting from her sorrows.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:34.250
Flower of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:45.690
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:50.750
Scaaaaarecroooow!

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:53.630
Tsubomi!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:54.270
Huh?

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.680
We've got trouble!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.140
Aki!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:58.840
Erika!

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:00.150
Let's do it!

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:13.900
Go forth, Seeds of the Precure!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.240
Precure!

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:19.790
Open My Heart!

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:07.530
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.730
Cure Blossom!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:18.330
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.840
Cure Marine!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:30.130
HeartCatch Precure!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.320
She's fast!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.860
Use a Red Seed!

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:42.250
Huh?

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.290
Match speed with speed!

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.130
The Blessed Perfume of Red Light!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:53.850
A spray makes my mood speed up!

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.440
Ready!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.310
Go!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.650
What the?! They're unbelievably fast!

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.910
Marine! It's time for Operation Eyespinny!

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.490
Yep, got it!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:32.750
Tch... Impertinent whelps!

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:33.520
Oh?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:41.640
I think Operation Eyespinny might be a failure...

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.730
My eyes have gone spinny instead...

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:47.150
Blossom and Marine are all dizzy!

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:52.240
What're these?!

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.080
I can't move!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.940
This way, Ryuunosuke!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:57.820
Dad!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:58.660
Mister!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:00.620
What the heck is that?!

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:04.060
Dad...

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:09.210
Dad, you never gave thought to how I felt.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:14.680
I can't run off and get married if it means leaving you all alone.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:17.140
Aki?! Is that you, Aki?!

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:19.850
Aki! Aki!

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:24.310
Aki!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.440
I'm sorry, Aki! I'm such a fool...

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:35.320
Aki, please, look at this!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.280
What?{She's literally just vocalizing 'gaku' which is like weird Japanese adjectomatopoeia for recieving a shock. Don't think there's a good way to deal with it so.}

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.990
It's a photograph I took of you both, as father and daughter!

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:43.920
This photo is filled with Tadashi's... no, your father's love for you!

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:45.960
And it's still just as strong as ever!

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:49.330
Your father was just being blunt with you so that you'd realize he was all right alone...

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:52.250
so you could get married without regrets!{The grammar on this one kind of blows. It's literally "Your father just wanted you to ease your fears so you could get married, that's why he was being blunt with you." Feel free to reword if you see fit.} {No, this works fine, I think.}

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.710
Crow...

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:04.960
<i>Aki!</i>

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.250
<i>Aki!</i>

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:14.440
Scare... crow...

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.040
The emotions captured by a photograph...

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.820
will never fade away!

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:22.780
It was from seeing you and how
 much Tadashi cared for his family...

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.740
that I decided I wanted to become a father like him!

00:18:26.740 --> 00:18:28.710
That I wanted to build a family like his!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:30.620
He made me see that!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:32.830
Dad!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.740
Emotions captured by photographs?

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.090
How utterly ludicrous!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:42.120
Photographs are but a tool to convey my beauty!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.560
You're wrong!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:44.560
Huh?!

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:46.480
Marine!

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:49.520
Blossom!

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:58.170
Precure Grand Explosion!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:04.160
Focusing your thoughts on what's before the camera and pressing the shutter!

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.580
Photography is about love!

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:08.760
What nonsense.

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:10.210
Get them, Desertrian!

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:11.750
Scarecrow!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:16.970
You're just toying with Aki's kind concern for her father.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:22.930
My heart may be vaster than the sea, but this is as much as it can take!

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.110
Gather, Floral Power!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.310
Marine Tact!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:48.500
Flowers, glitter bright!

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:56.770
Precure Blue Forte Wave!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:17.720
Tch. How pitiful you are, to not appreciate my beauty!

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:29.740
All right then. Let's make this the best family photograph you'll ever have.{BECAUSE, YA KNOW, NO-ONE CARED ABOUT YOUR MOTHER.}

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:34.250
The best... family photograph?

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:38.030
Dad, I...

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:38.740
Hm?

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:42.170
I think I might be the one who'll be lonely without you.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.410
Aki, you should know that no matter how old you are...

00:20:47.960 --> 00:20:49.720
you'll always be my daughter.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:53.190
That won't change just because you've gotten married.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:56.200
I know.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:01.420
Make sure you build yourself a wonderful family.

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:03.590
I will.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:08.860
In the language of flowers, a sweet potato means "a bride's joy." {Period inside quotes.}

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:12.020
I'm sure Aki will be a very happy bride.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:19.380
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born...

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:33.820
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:43.940
You know, photos really are amazing.

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:45.780
I have a new admiration for them.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:50.570
That's right! A photo is all about the relationship between the photographer and...

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:50.080
Stop!

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:52.910
What I'm trying to say is...

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:56.290
that you're amazing, Dad!

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:09.920
{ED}

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.490 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:36.210
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:39.180
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.640 --> 00:22:44.800
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:48.180
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.770
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.770
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.150 --> 00:22:56.610
is about to begin!

00:22:57.110 --> 00:22:59.820
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.740
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.660
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:07.200
We're pretty

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:09.000
at full bloom!

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:12.120
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:15.170
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.710
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:20.960
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.340 --> 00:23:23.970
So don't sulk

00:23:24.180 --> 00:23:26.890
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.350
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:33.560
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.440
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:39.940
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:44.940
<i>We've gathered more and more Heart Seeds...</i>

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:47.280
<i>...and we've finally got something to show for it!</i>

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:51.740
<i>The Great Heart Tree gives birth to a yellow wonder, whose body holds hidden strength like dynamite!</i>

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:52.950
<i>My name's Potpourri!</i>

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:55.150
<i>Yay! Wahoo! We did it!</i>

00:23:55.150 --> 00:23:56.330
<i>Our super pretty...</i>

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.830
<i>...and super cute new friend, Potpourri!</i>

00:23:58.830 --> 00:24:00.750
<i>Nice to meet ya! We'll all be working with you!</i>

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.210
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:06.130
The Third Fairy<i>!</i>

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:06.130
The Third Fairy<i>!</i>

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:08.910
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
